<title>HONG KONG: Apple says signs China distribution deal.</title>
<headline>Apple says signs China distribution deal.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Computer International Ltd said on Friday it had signed a distribution agreement with China's Hua Dong Electronic Technology Service Corp, a subsidiary of East China Computer Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The U.S. computer maker said in a statement the agreement would expand its market reach in eastern China.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Hua Dong will distribute and support the latest Apple products.</p>
<p>Apple said its products are sold by more than 200 resellers in China, including 70 Apple shops.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
